    {
      "id": "831bd92f48e0ca44bf3a15df3a6b4a5dec555d8f",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 766675025,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@j.novak I would still like to merge this because the current implementation is fragile and blocking some other improvements. So we should not have some hidden dependency on stdout debug logging.\n\nThis patch passes a flag to an extcap to signal \"child mode\" (in case it cares) and also fixes base logging to never write to the parent process any debug information (no matter the file stream), because the parent is not prepared to handle it, and if it happens to go into stderr it will break things, as you discovered.\n\nDo you know where we should document this --capchild flag?\n\n> 1. It logs some messages to console even just file should be used.\n\nThis is intentional, as we discussed before.\n\n> 2. Log messages on console are messy.\n\nThis was a bug. It should be fixed in the latest iteration.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bea5f745397cf5a2fe0526df96ec143db47f9334340ab56515038832be57e976?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/jvalverde"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-12-11T18:39:48.472Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-12-12T09:38:19.926Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 129309887,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 5322,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 767992319,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think that documentation of this flag should be added to doc/extcap.adoc and docbook/wsdg_src/WSDG_chapter_capture.adoc. BTW I think that doc/extcap.adoc can be removed or replaced with link do WSDG as it is outdated and incomplete.\n\nI see that extcap/extcap-base.c handles --capchild on extcap side for every extcap. But there is special case - doc/extcap_example.py which is in Python and stays outside of source code tree. It should be adapted too.",
          "author": {
