        {
          "id": 769388374,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Can I ask you to check this (you can use any other extcap):\n\n./run/extcap/udpdump --extcap-interface udpdump --capture\n\nIt prints error with ws_warning(), but then it cores. I found that when ws_warning() is changed e.g. to ws_info(), it works fine. I found it cores with 2.4 branch too (it is the oldest binary I have). Isn't it strange?",
